 'comm.hero.lede1':'Women’s basketball community in East Jakarta','comm.hero.lede2':'Men’s basketball community in East Jakarta','comm.desc1':'Want to play but don’t have a crew yet? Come say hi. Tobaladies is where women find teammates, level up together, and have fun on court.','comm.desc2':'Want a sparring partner or a regular crew? Tobadeli is it — grown from the BKT and Brickhouse The East scene. Check the schedule, show up, fill the court.','deli.cta1':'Join the Squad','deli.cta2':'View Game Schedule','merch.join.squad':'Join the Squad','deli.link':'Hit the Court','deli.meet':'Meet Tobadeli','comm.cta1':'Join the community','comm.cta2':'See upcoming events','comm.eyebrow2':'LATIHAN DAN SPARRING SETIAP MINGGU','comm.about':'WHAT WE DO','comm.h':'Train, spar, and do it all again.','comm.lede':'Skill training, weekend fun games, and occasional sparring. Every level welcome. Show up and play.','comm.link':'Check the next game','comm.f1':'Drinking Water Included','comm.f1s':'Drinking water is provided to support training sessions and community games.','comm.f2':'Free Photo/Video Highlights','comm.f2s':'Capture training and sparring moments through photo and video highlights.','comm.f3':'Real games','comm.f3s':'Sparring and fun games','comm.f4':'Active weekly','comm.f4s':'There is always something on','comm.pill':'For every level','comm.pill.d':'Never played or coming back from a break? You are welcome. Just bring your shoes.','comm.illust':'Community activity photo','deli.story.eyebrow':'THE STORY BEHIND TOBADELI','deli.story.h':'It started with playing basketball together.','deli.story.p1':'Tobadeli is where TOBA began — built on the court around BKT and Brickhouse The East, through hangouts, training, and hard sparring. No fluff: just people to play with, and the drive to keep leveling up.','deli.story.p2':'After one year, TOBA grew with the arrival of Tobaladies. Now there are two groups, but still one community and one spirit on the court.','tl.story.eyebrow':'THE STORY BEHIND TOBALADIES','tl.story.h':'It started with wanting a place to play.','tl.story.lead':'Tobaladies exists because women in East Jakarta also wanted a place to play basketball. It started with a few people who regularly met up and trained around BKT.','tl.story.p1':'Slowly, meetups became training sessions and sparring. One year after Tobadeli started, Tobaladies joined as the women’s group of TOBA Community.','tl.story.p2':'Here you can start from zero, find people to play with, and grow together. You don’t have to be great to join.','tl.story.acts':'Aktivitas di lapangan','tl.story.acts.1':'Latihan skill rutin','tl.story.acts.2':'Friendly game antar komunitas','tl.story.acts.3':'Sesi kebersamaan dan dokumentasi','tl.story.acts.4':'Bagian dari Weekly Fun Game TOBA','tl.founder.eyebrow':'FOUNDER','tl.founder.name':'Karel Erick','tl.founder.role':'Founder Tobaladies','tl.founder.body':'Tobaladies dibangun oleh Karel Erick bersama para pemain perempuan pertama yang mau mencoba. Pengelolaannya berjalan bersama: latihan, jadwal, dan dokumentasi dikerjakan bareng anggota.','tl.founder.missing':'Catatan: kutipan founder dan detail perjalanan akan ditambahkan setelah data asli dikonfirmasi pengurus.',
 'story.h':'From the Court, Into a Family.','story.kicker':'TOBA. TONGKRONGAN BASKET','story.lead':'TOBA started with friends who kept meeting at the courts around BKT, East Jakarta. It began as fun games, then grew into a community. Everything started here.','story.circle.h':'One TOBA, Two Families.','story.circle.lede':'Different characters, one passion. Tobadeli and Tobaladies grow together within one community, TOBA.','story.ladies.name':'Tongkrongan Basket Ladies','story.ladies.d':'Tongkrongan Basket Ladies, a place where women players meet, grow, and enjoy the game.','story.deli.name':'Tongkrongan Basket Dekat Kali','story.deli.d':"TOBA’s men’s crew — born and raised around the BKT and Brickhouse The East courts.",'story.bridge.h':'It All Started With One Person.','story.bridge.p':'That habit kept going, the group kept growing — and it all started from one person. Meet the founder below.','story.scroll':'KEEP SCROLLING','founder.name':'Karel Erick','founder.role':'Founder TOBA','founder.eyebrow':'FOUNDER. THE STORY BEHIND TOBA','founder.body':'TOBA started from a simple habit: a group of friends who kept coming back to the same court around BKT, East Jakarta. From casual runs it grew into a community — Tobaladies and Tobadeli — with one shared belief: everyone deserves a court to come back to.','founder.note':'Founder’s full journey and vision notes will be published once confirmed with TOBA management.',
