 'brand.note':'TOBA stands for Tongkrongan Basket, not a place, a crew. Bukan soal asal mana, tapi soal ketemu teman yang sama-sama suka basket.','brand.h':'The name behind the court.','brand.p1':'TOBA stands for Tongkrongan Basket. The name says it all: a place to hang out, find teammates, and actually play. It was never about where you come from — it is about showing up and hooping together.','brand.p2':'Tobaladies is short for Tongkrongan Basket Ladies — the women\'s side of the community, loud and proud in pink.','brand.p3':'Tobadeli means Tongkrongan Basket Dekat Kali — inspired by the court life around BKT (Banjir Kanal Timur) near Brickhouse The East, our home base in East Jakarta.','brand.name.ladies':'Tongkrongan Basket Ladies','brand.name.deli':'Tongkrongan Basket Dekat Kali','brand.deli.note':'Named after where we play: along BKT (Banjir Kanal Timur), right by Brickhouse The East, East Jakarta.','ladies.full':'Tongkrongan Basket Ladies','deli.full':'Tongkrongan Basket Dekat Kali',
