 'tobi.aria':'TOBI — Toba Assistant, open chat','tobi.ph':'Ask TOBI…','tobi.link':'Open page','tobi.status':'Online',
 'tobi.greet.1':'Hey! I\'m TOBI, your TOBA Assistant. Looking for information about our community or upcoming games?',
 'tobi.greet.2':'Hi, TOBI here from TOBA Community. Want to know about play schedules, costs, or community activities? Just ask!',
 'tobi.greet.3':'Hey! I\'m TOBI. Ask me anything: schedules, prices, membership, or events.',
 'tobi.welcome.1':'Hey! I\'m TOBI, your TOBA Assistant. New to TOBA? I can help you learn about our community, weekly games, and how to join.',
 'tobi.welcome.2':'Hello! I\'m TOBI, your TOBA Community Assistant. How can I help you today?',
 'tobi.welcome.3':'Welcome! I\'m TOBI, TOBA Community\'s assistant. I can help with play schedules, session fees, membership, registration, and what the Tobaladies & Tobadeli crews are up to. What would you like to know?',
 'tobi.hi.1':'Hey! What can I do for you?','tobi.hi.2':'Hello! Ask me anything about TOBA Community.',
 'tobi.thanks.1':'You\'re welcome! See you on the court.','tobi.thanks.2':'Anytime! Happy hooping.',
 'tobi.bye.1':'See you, baller!',
 'tobi.basket.1':'Basketball is always better with a crew. Around East Jakarta, TOBA runs weekly games and sessions — want me to point you to the schedule?',
 'tobi.out.1':'That one is a bit outside my court. I know TOBA Community best — schedules, fees, membership, activities. Anything about that? I\'d rather not guess at the rest.',
